  "body": "## Tech Kadak v1.1.0 🔥\r\n\r\n**Apps ab app ke andar hi download + install** (Play Store jaisa) — official GitHub / F-Droid se, Kadak Bot 🤖 ke saath. Background download, notification me %, net gaya to wahi se resume.\r\n\r\n**Kya naya hai**\r\n- 🤖 In-app Install / Open / Update • Downloads & Updates screen • Apps auto-update (Off / Wi-Fi / Hamesha)\r\n- 🎨 Customise: AMOLED / Dark / Light theme, accent colour + colour picker, font size, card style, home sections, Hinglish / English\r\n- ❤️ Favourites + Haal me dekhe • Sort & filter (Free / Freemium / Open-source)\r\n- 🔐 Login (optional): Google • Email • Phone OTP — \"Abhi skip karo\" bhi\r\n- ✨ Naya lime splash + 4-screen intro • \"Aaj ka App\" home-screen widget • About + version history\r\n- ⬆️ In-app update: \"Abhi update karo\" / \"Baad me\"\r\n\r\n**Install:** neeche `TechKadak-v1.1.apk` download karo → open → Install (v1.0 hai to Update).\r\n"
